  unitName: Red Hood Ciara
  unitId: 810104
  unitNumber: 8040
  description: Ciara came from a peasant family living a simple life in the woods.
    When she turned twelve, her family was slain by a pack of wolves, leaving her
    barely escaping, crying and stumbling into the deep forests. She wandered for
    days in the dark before she met a mysterious woman who called herself Semira.
    Semira took her in and trained her in mystical dark arts. On Ciara's seventeenth
    birthday, Semira handed her an enchanted scythe and said, "Only you can cut down
    your deepest fears". Ciara finally bidded goodbye to Semira the following year,
    making her way back to face her deepest fears. She wears a red hood, a memento
    from the past, given to her by her grandmother.
  summonDesc: Help me face my deepest fears..
  fusionDesc: I will get stronger to face my fears..
